provider_wiring = "Resolved within the authorized account scope: AccountProvider passes the explicitly configured hostedUrl to EndpointClient; NEXT_PUBLIC_PAXEER_HOSTED_URL is validated independently of the node URL. Receipt-only views do not require a hosted service; missing hosted configuration surfaces the SDK error for bank reads without a node fallback."
